OL,3,ANvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang     
OL,4,Aafter affair with alleged spy as Trump 
OL,5,Asays 'I made the deal'                 
OL,7,FThe AI giant's board says he's the     
OL,8,F"right person" to lead, and his return 
OL,9,Fis in "the best interests of our       
OL,10,Fstockholders, employees, partners and  
OL,11,Fcustomers"                             
OL,13,FTrump - who has pushed for Huang's     
OL,14,Freinstatement - calls him a "great     
OL,15,Fpatriot" and says the US government has
OL,16,F"no reason to believe" his return poses
OL,17,Fa national security risk               
OL,19,FHuang says: "I take this responsibility
OL,20,Fwith the greatest humility and renewed 
OL,21,Fcommitment" - read his full statement  
